  "prompt": "Use case: illustration-story. One 4:3 landscape watercolor for The Burnt Book Sanskrit lesson future.sya. Refined Indian watercolor with restrained gouache on warm ivory; muted ochre, sage, terracotta and indigo. At dawn in a quiet old grove, a slender friendly adult spirit made of pale morning light leans forward as if ready to run, long hair swept forward. He wears an opaque ivory kurta and dhoti. Above, the amused ash-grey Vetala spirit hangs upside down by its ankles from a sturdy branch, arms folded, wearing a complete opaque long grey tunic and trousers secured at the ankles. In the foreground: learner seen from behind in ochre kurta and cloth shoulder bag; grandmother with silver bun, round glasses, cream sari with maroon border and grey shawl; bright green rose-ringed parrot with red beak. Soft dawn glows beyond the trees. Gentle curious storytelling, fully clothed figures, compact clear central group, essential faces and hands away from the edges. This scene needs no writing. No invented script, watermark, UI, border or frightening imagery.",
